hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"150","Al-Zaafrani, Ziyad bin Yahya Al-Hasani, Ishaq bin Hatim bin Sinan Al-Madani, may God bless bin Musa, and the group said: Yahya bin Sulaym told us, Ismail bin Kathir told us, on the authority of Asim bin Laqit bin Sabra, on the authority of his father, he said: I said: O Messenger God, tell me about ablution. He said: “Perform ablution thoroughly, intersperse your fingers, and exhale deeply, unless you are fasting.”"
